					"nextDialogs": [
						230131120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230131120,
					"content": "史莱姆凝液就拜托您了，旅行者，我会准备好报酬的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131111,
					"content": "你们没赚钱的方法吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230131112,
					"content": "不是没有赚钱的方法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131113,
					"content": "而是没有赚钱的能力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131114,
					"content": "非常感谢你的补充，路通。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131115,
					"content": "唉，非常惭愧…虽然我说我已经制造出了「推数机」，但它的功能实在太过简单。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131116,
					"content": "怎么说呢，就连「运算」这件事也不能完全自行做到，需要我手动做很多辅助工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131117,
					"content": "但是…我一定会完善它！我充分地相信，我的「推数机」将是一个伟大的发明！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131118,
					"content": "一个…一个宣告新时代和旧时代交替的发明！然后我一定能找到赚钱的方法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 230131119,
					"content": "但，但是在那之前…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230131120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
